==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gd|en}} {{m|gd|gall||foreigner or stranger}}, meaning:
* {{qualifier|Ireland}} a person from Wales or England who [[immigrate]]d after the Norman invasion, or
* {{qualifier|Scotland}} a person from [[Scandinavia]] or the English-speaking lowlands.

